Z||000000||Tony||01-20-2001||08:17 AM||||I've noticed a few references on this Forum to The Edge Products offroad buggies so I thought I'd introduce myself & put a link here to our webpage for readers reference. I'm Tony Sanger & run a business here in Perth, Western Australia called The Edge Products. We design, manufacture & sell plans, parts & kitsets for a range of Offroad buggies, everything from a 3.5hp Offroad kids Go Kart right up to 1100cc motorcycle powered 120mph fully suspended offroad racers, plus everthing inbetween. We freight our plans, parts & kitsets world wide & currently have a booming export market in Saudi Arabia. So if your into building your own fun machines in the garage check us out!. <A HREF="http://www.git.com.au/~theedge/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.git.com.au/~theedge/index.htm</A> ||||reg||3
